'''Elderwood Blade''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2022 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
It has a jagged tanto-shaped blade that is dark green in color with a cracked texture over it. The edge of the blade is purple, and streaks of purple can be seen along the spine.  The guard and handle, resembling a tree branch, are purple in color and are connected together. Part of the guard curls onto the spine of the blade, and the other part droops in front of the handle.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Elderwood Blade]], which was found in the same box.
*It is part of the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Full_Elderwood_Set Full Elderwood Set] with [[Elderwood Scythe]] and [[Elderwood Revolver]].
*It has four [[Unique Weapons|unique]] counterparts that were released as trophies for finishing on the Top 100 leaderboard during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]], those being the [[Blue Elderwood Blade]], [[Bronze Elderwood Blade]], [[Silver Elderwood Blade]], and [[Gold Elderwood Blade]].

